{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100511","id":2239833292,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FgSTM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100511","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100511.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100511.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100511","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100511/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100511/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100511/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e083ea4aa6c8a1a562e8b1906eb804d6e86a605c","number":100511,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Remove duplicate code between `intersects_ray` and `intersects_segment`","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In `AABB`, `Plane`, `Geometry3D` _[Edit : and `TriangleMesh`]_ functions `ray_intersects_*` and `segment_intersects_*` involve almost identical code. In some cases both flavors even diverged over time which complexifies maintenance.\r\n\r\nThis PR :\r\n- extends `ray_intersects_*` with an additional parameter `distance` that clamps the raycast in the same fashion as `segment_intersects_*`. `distance` is defaulted to `0.0` which enables infinite raycasting \r\n- makes `segment_intersects_*` wrap calls to `ray_intersects_*`. It avoids duplication and opens the way to eventually deprecating `intersects_segment_*` in the future, as they suffer from numerical precision issues (see related issue #100475)\r\n- adds the `Geometry3D::ray_intersects_*` counterparts to `segment_intersects_sphere`, `_cylinder` and `_convex`\r\n- enhances tests of `AABB` and `Geometry3D` to validate the above changes","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MD